# Build products. Every lib*.so here is produced by the mxcc command documented in
# RESULTS.md from the .cu beside it; there are 46 of them, up to 1.8 MB each, and
# they go stale the moment a source file changes. Nobody should pull binaries.
*.so

# Scratch run output. These are progress bars and partially-flushed rows; the
# numbers worth keeping are transcribed into RESULTS.md, which is the record.
*.log

# Python / Triton caches.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
